cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or the STEMBench dataset in your research, please cite
  it as below.
title: LLM-STEMBench
type: software
authors:
  - name: LLM-STEMBench contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/aayushkrm/llm-stembench
url: https://github.com/aayushkrm/llm-stembench
abstract: >-
  Provider-agnostic LLM evaluation pipeline (accuracy, calibration, paired model
  comparison statistics, error taxonomy tooling) and STEMBench, an original bilingual
  Russian-English benchmark of mathematics, physics, and chemistry problems with
  procedurally generated, independently verified answers.
keywords:
  - large language models
  - benchmark
  - STEM
  - evaluation
  - calibration
  - bilingual
license: MIT
commit: filled-at-release
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-17"
